,"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"水仙　菫……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-10a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"nekoneko soft的『菫』的女主角菫、\n将作为重要主角登场的故事。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-182","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-182"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"因此，为了观众能够理解，\n而加入了一定灯里的角色设定与背景的部分。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-204","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-204"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"本身是一种叙事诡计的构成，所以我想会很难理解吧","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-255","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-255"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"所以如果你能想到【原来是这种设定的角色吗】\n大家只要这样模糊地感受到，我也会非常感谢的","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-2cb","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2cb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"总之。我强行把它放进了水仙的故事里、\n请忽略立绘变得奇怪的事实＞＜","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-351","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-351"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"另外，这作的时间点是水仙2之后4-5年、水仙1的1-2年前。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00\",\"main\"]/mjo-3aa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_sumire/%23mjo/narsumi00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3aa"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那么 好久不见 感谢您的游玩＞＜","speaker":"旁白"}}]}
